	(text "The Olimex RP2350-XL Module can not be powered from external 3V3, but requires external 5V.\nThe Module has a TPS62A02, which can not be disabled since it has Active Output Discharge. \nActive Output Discharge connects the output via a resistor to GND.\nThe extra diode is needed to protect against potential USB power."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
